// Minimal native viewport startup smoke fixture
// Purpose: Validate native viewport host startup with Win32 platform services
// Requirements: 4.2, 8.1, 13.4, 13.5

// This is the simplest possible viewport program that triggers native viewport startup.
// It has a minimal scene with no geometry, no materials, no shaders - just enough
// to validate that the native runtime can initialize Win32 app host, input host,
// OpenGL context, and viewport scene loading.

component ViewportSmoke():
    render <panel title="Viewport Startup Smoke" layout="dock">
        <viewport3d title="Minimal Viewport" scene="empty_scene" />
    </panel>
